<title>HONG KONG: Tyler appointed as HAECO director.</title>
<headline>Tyler appointed as HAECO director.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tony Tyler has been appointed a director of the Hong Kong Aircraft Engineering Co Ltd (HAECO), Swire Group said on Friday.</p>
<p>Tyler, currently director of service delivery at Cathay Pacific Airways Ltd, will take over from Rod Eddington as of December 1, the Hong Kong-based conglomerate said in a press release.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
</text>
